id=encore
name=Encore Tweaks (Transsion)
version=
versionCode=
author=drybrine, Rem01Gaming
description=Encore Tweaks for Infinix / Tecno / itel (Transsion XOS). Same tweaks as upstream, plus a fix for what defeated them on these devices: com.transsion.usf owns the thermal policy that clamped Encore's clock tweaks. Default method disables USF entirely (cpu, gpu, brightness, refresh, fps, volume all stop); method cpu patches only the CPU cap.
updateJson=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/drybrine/encore-transsion/main/update.json
banner=banner.webp
webuiIcon=webroot/icon.webp
